@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama 3: POST /.../discrepancies/drivers/:driverId/consolidate

actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor
participant "App Móvil" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Distributor Service" as Service
participant "Transaction DB\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "transport_order_\ncount_sessions DB" as SessionDB
participant "transport_order_count_\nsession_items DB" as SessionItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB

Supervisor -> App: Tap en "Consolidar Diferencias"
note left of App
  El FE envía el array con los 
  conteos finales (unidad mínima) 
  aprobados por el supervisor.
end note

App -> Gateway: POST /.../drivers/12/consolidate
Gateway -> Service: consolidateDriverDiscrepancies(driverId, payload, executorId)

Service -> Service: 1. groupByTransportOrder(payload.items)
note right of Service
  Agrupa los ítems por 'transportOrderId'
  ya que la tabla de sesiones exige 
  registrar por OT, no por chofer.
end note

Service -> TX: 2. startTransaction()
activate TX

loop Por cada transportOrderId afectado
    Service -> SessionDB: 3. insertCountSession(orderId, executorId)
    note right of SessionDB
      INSERT INTO transport_order_count_sessions:
      - session_type = 'SUPERVISOR_DISCREPANCY'
      - status = 'COMPLETED'
      - executor_role = 'SUPERVISOR'
    end note
    SessionDB --> Service: newSessionId

    Service -> SessionItemsDB: 4. insertCountSessionItems(newSessionId, items)
    note right of SessionItemsDB
      INSERT masivo para auditoría:
      - counted_qty = finalCountedUnits
      - variance_qty = (counted - expected)
    end note
    SessionItemsDB --> Service: ok
end

Service -> InvDB: 5. bulkUpdateInventories(allProcessedItems)
note right of InvDB
  Masivo UPDATE en truck_inventories:
  - loaded_qty = finalCountedUnits
  - variance_qty = (counted - expected)
  - verified_supervisor_id = executorId
  - status = 'APPROVED'
end note
InvDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 6. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: consolidationSuccessResponse
Gateway --> App: 200 OK (Consolidation Success)
App --> Supervisor: Redirige a Pantalla de Éxito o Lista
@enduml